# Release check for tiny-node-lib

Dependencies are installed with `npm ci` and the tests run with `npm test`.
See the [testing guide](https://docs.npmjs.com/cli/) and the [contributing notes](https://github.com/steplet-corpus/tiny-node-lib/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md).

Report the summary line exactly as printed.
